                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "604216f7-7dfe-456d-b7c3-a2084f4b310e",
                        "entry_id": "473961c8-5323-321d-bde2-21cc5b550f6a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "écrivaillons"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "8b0b3cb7-5f5d-4f33-ba56-97c04a26046c",
                        "entry_id": "473961c8-5323-321d-bde2-21cc5b550f6a",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "écrivaillonne"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a19d7a44-13d2-39f7-8cae-3671b64a7681",
                        "entry_id": "473961c8-5323-321d-bde2-21cc5b550f6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Écrivain médiocre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar",
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "27f020e8-d60a-4ead-b596-c3361689a4b9",
                                "sense_id": "a19d7a44-13d2-39f7-8cae-3671b64a7681",
                                "text": "Il a pris du poil de la bête en apprenant que j’écrivais :\n— Les écrivaillons de Saint-Germain-des-Prés, j’en fais un chaque matin.\n— Ça, lui ai-je dit, c’est un jugement littéraire.\n— À propos de jugement, vous feriez mieux de la boucler parce qu’il y a aussi des flagrants délits qui sont drôlement bien torchés."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "faa35312-fd1c-4109-b19e-60444d0a1174",
                                "sense_id": "a19d7a44-13d2-39f7-8cae-3671b64a7681",
                                "text": "Alors si un putain d’écrivaillon, pris sous votre aile, pouvait sortir un livre qui redore notre blason et fasse que les instances supérieures me lâchent un peu la bride : je prends."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1037c1f4-b101-43af-a817-3a3c476e704e",
                        "source_entry_id": "473961c8-5323-321d-bde2-21cc5b550f6a",
                        "source_sense_id": "a19d7a44-13d2-39f7-8cae-3671b64a7681",
                        "target_lang_word": "Vielschreiber",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Vielschreiber",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae41f945-401b-3216-be3f-62e495176692",
                                        "entry_id": "b8ab665e-e5e0-3259-b695-1ba4881d8ac6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die sehr viele Texte verfasst, dabei aber Qualitätsstandards oft verfehlt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "967964f0-2d62-48a6-9c1a-e31711ed5b7e",
                                                "sense_id": "ae41f945-401b-3216-be3f-62e495176692",
                                                "text": "„Obwohl Dik ein überaus produktiver Vielschreiber war, gelangte er dabei nicht zu Wohlstand.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6b2f8788-e33b-49dc-9970-9e8161075fc0",
                        "source_entry_id": "473961c8-5323-321d-bde2-21cc5b550f6a",
                        "source_sense_id": "a19d7a44-13d2-39f7-8cae-3671b64a7681",
                        "target_lang_word": "scribbler",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "scribbler",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1868a7a3-507f-3135-8f21-cc76e036c53b",
                                        "entry_id": "3cd8f5ac-5e75-3447-846e-1cdc638a24ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who scribbles; a hasty or untalented writer or artist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "072ea513-6dc6-488d-88df-f4b4495efdf5",
                                                "sense_id": "1868a7a3-507f-3135-8f21-cc76e036c53b",
                                                "text": "The scribbler, pinch'd with hunger, writes to dine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6778315-cd0a-497b-b837-3ad4f4300b0a",
                                                "sense_id": "1868a7a3-507f-3135-8f21-cc76e036c53b",
                                                "text": "\"That's what I have been talking to you, sir - scientific gibberish! Did you think you could match cunning with me - you with your walnut of a brain? You think you are omnipotent, you infernal scribblers, don't you? That your praise can make a man and your blame can break him?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d83ef87-3608-3818-8d03-190a307f0d9f",
                                        "entry_id": "3cd8f5ac-5e75-3447-846e-1cdc638a24ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A machine for coarse carding or teasing of wool."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11d2c69d-a8c7-3433-91d0-e7288148829c",
                                        "entry_id": "3cd8f5ac-5e75-3447-846e-1cdc638a24ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ruled notebook or exercise book, especially in grade school."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a38859d8-1406-4b1b-963b-fc5edd758c22",
                        "source_entry_id": "473961c8-5323-321d-bde2-21cc5b550f6a",
                        "source_sense_id": "a19d7a44-13d2-39f7-8cae-3671b64a7681",
                        "target_lang_word": "juntaletras",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "juntaletras",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f74704d-7eac-39e4-b6b4-bf0d29021e19",
                                        "entry_id": "744f41f0-73a6-3a79-9595-7caf69ea5357",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Escritor de poca importancia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00cc215e-11e1-4a55-9eda-d326df004029",
                                                "sense_id": "6f74704d-7eac-39e4-b6b4-bf0d29021e19",
                                                "text": "En la Segunda Bis, también, controlábamos los movimientos de periodistas, poetas, dramaturgos, pintores, marchantes, catedráticos de Instituto o Universidad, juntaletras de medio pelo y filósofos de pacotilla."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bad1f785-bb3d-4550-9e84-ba735978752d",
                        "source_entry_id": "473961c8-5323-321d-bde2-21cc5b550f6a",
                        "source_sense_id": "a19d7a44-13d2-39f7-8cae-3671b64a7681",
                        "target_lang_word": "escribidor",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "escribidor",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e201fb65-f5f8-371e-9e3c-ce55bf927ef3",
                                        "entry_id": "b809fd8b-d3ed-3e22-ba3c-f49a7ca9c874",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Escritor de escaso o nulo talento."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb35b817-a555-466f-8384-d65138eb0248",
                                                "sense_id": "e201fb65-f5f8-371e-9e3c-ce55bf927ef3",
                                                "text": "Los visionarios influyentes, que oyen voces celestiales, defienden utopías nacidas algunos años antes en el cerebro de algún escribidor de facultad."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "519f8f14-f219-361c-a34c-8a528772fa23",
                                        "entry_id": "b809fd8b-d3ed-3e22-ba3c-f49a7ca9c874",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Escritor. Persona que antiguamente cuando el analfabetismo estaba muy extendido ponía a disposición de los demás su capacidad de escribir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32b31191-a75b-4d6d-bf41-ed7f5c5efe96",
                                                "sense_id": "519f8f14-f219-361c-a34c-8a528772fa23",
                                                "text": "Aunque, se tranquilizó, había tiempo: por el momento no pensaba aplicarse al noble arte de darse muerte -como había leído que habían hecho muchos de los más insignes poetas de la historia-, sino al discreto, aunque meritorio, quehacer de escribidor de cartas."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
